{"id": 25, "ts": 1780612017.7157302, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I appreciate Sarah\u2019s clarification that we have no concrete observations of Candidate\u202fA\u2019s stress\u2011resilience, decision\u2011making under pressure, or attention to detail. Those are core safety criteria for long\u2011haul operations, and the absence of evidence weakens A\u2019s otherwise strong technical foresight. In contrast, Candidate\u202fB is explicitly described as \u201cvery conscientious\u201d and \u201chandles stress very well,\u201d directly covering the reliability and stress\u2011resilience gaps we identified for A. Although B\u2019s crew\u2011cooperation issues and his relatively weak memory for numbers raise concerns, those can be addressed through targeted CRM training and procedural checks, whereas A\u2019s missing evidence on critical performance under pressure cannot be mitigated without data. Therefore, I am shifting my provisional recommendation to Candidate\u202fB, while we continue to probe B\u2019s attention\u2011to\u2011detail risk and explore the remaining candidates."}
